<note appliesTo="source">line: 5</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>This add-on allows to listen the typed symbols (non alphanumeric or blank characters), even when the speaking of typed characters is turned off in NVDA.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="ce34f3e9-70a9-488b-8058-fa67129973c6">
